nodes.body:
I made one more change for the open question on this PR. Commit 297f7af357 adds a test assertion for an explicit `XPU` request on XPU, and the thread reply has the details.

I also updated the PR body. It now has a short summary at the top, the exact behaviour on CUDA (also under `SGLANG_PROFILE_V2=1`) and the new assertion with its mutant result. The CI note now says why the CI runs stop at the maintenance gate. No CI lane runs XPU tests on `intel_dev`, so the results come from local runs.

@jianan-gu, could you take another look when you have a moment? If nothing else is open, please approve.

